#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every feature is free: all {templates} templates, PDF and Word downloads, the ATS checker, cover letters and the job tracker. There are no ads, no tracking and no paid tier. Donations pay for hosting and development."
msgstr "Da. Vsaka funkcija je brezplačna: vse predloge {templates}, prenosi PDF in Word, pregledovalnik ATS, spremna pisma in sledilnik delovnih mest. Ni oglasov, ni sledenja in ni plačane stopnje. Donacije plačajo gostovanje in razvoj."

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every job you track gets its own workspace: check your fit against the posting, draft answers from stories you wrote once, get a short plan before the interview, practise out loud with feedback and debrief afterwards. When offers arrive, compare them side by side. The coaching uses your own AI key; the comparison doesn’t need one."
msgstr "Da. Vsako delovno mesto, ki ga spremljate, dobi svoj delovni prostor: preverite ujemanje z oglasom, pripravite osnutke odgovorov iz zgodb, ki ste jih napisali enkrat, pred intervjujem dobite kratek načrt, vadite na glas s povratnimi informacijami in po njem naredite analizo. Ko prispejo ponudbe, jih primerjajte drugo ob drugi. Svetovanje uporablja vaš lastni ključ AI; primerjava ga ne potrebuje."

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Import a PDF, a LinkedIn data export, a JSON Resume file or a Reactive Resume export, then pick up where it left off. With an AI provider set up, Word documents work too."
msgstr "ja Uvozite izvoz podatkov PDF, LinkedIn, datoteko JSON Resume ali izvoz Reactive Resume in nato nadaljujte tam, kjer ste končali. Z nastavljenim ponudnikom AI delujejo tudi dokumenti Word."

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Reactive Resume is open source under the MIT License and ships as a Docker image, so it runs on your own server with your own database and storage."
msgstr "ja Reactive Resume je odprtokoden pod MIT License in se pošilja kot slika Docker, tako da deluje na vašem lastnem strežniku z vašo lastno bazo podatkov in prostorom za shranjevanje."

